WEBVTT

00:00:28.246 --> 00:00:30.594
projektovao je umetničke slike na zid

00:00:30.594 --> 00:00:33.487
pitajući nas

00:00:33.487 --> 00:00:36.013
šta mislimo o njima.

00:00:36.013 --> 00:00:39.708
Bio je to pejzaž sa figurama, poluobučenim,

00:00:39.708 --> 00:00:42.496
kako piju vino. Tu je bila naga žena

00:00:42.496 --> 00:00:45.872
u donjem prednjem delu, a na brežuljku u pozadini

00:00:45.872 --> 00:00:49.886
bila je mitološka figura boga Baha

00:00:49.886 --> 00:00:52.235
i on je pitao: "Šta je ovo?"

00:00:52.235 --> 00:00:55.512
I ja – niko drugi, podigao sam ruku i rekao:

00:00:55.512 --> 00:00:58.873
"To su Ticijanove Bahanalije."

00:00:58.873 --> 00:01:01.526
On, na to: "To je - šta?"